{"type":"step-attempt","step":"design","sessionId":"074c5ed2-c751-40b8-a903-db08a9dd7364","outcome":{"verdict":"success","findingsPath":null,"error":null,"toolResult":{"ok":true,"reason":"Wrote design.md, spec.md, and tasks.md under specrunner/changes/bite-evidence-test-file-selection/ on branch change/bite-evidence-test-file-selection-ba76155d. Plan introduces a single shared test-file selection predicate (new leaf module src/core/step/bite-evidence/test-file-selection.ts) consumed by both gate.ts and achieved-assurance.ts, adds verification.scopedTestPatterns config (default [\"**/*.test.*\",\"**/*.spec.*\",\"**/*_test.*\"]) with a dependency-free glob→RegExp matcher and non-empty-array validation (CONFIG_INVALID), changes the empty-selection gate verdict from failed to strategy-deferred (aligning gate.ts:13 doc / :76 comment), and scopes the floor's blob-freeze tamper check to test files only. All request acceptance criteria are mapped to tasks T-01..T-09. No source/config/docs edited — left for the implementer.","status":"success"},"followUpAttempts":0,"transientRetryAttempts":0,"addedTurns":{"reportRetry":0,"postWork":0,"outputRepair":0}},"startedAt":"2026-07-31T14:21:34.563Z","endedAt":"2026-07-31T14:30:05.157Z","commitOid":"1dcd90dbe3fc898bb7597ec42b9ea68a0e62d99e"}
